# Uploaded content is tracked in git so the board stays intact when the
# project is moved to another machine. Subdirectories mirror the resource
# names accepted by AdminContentController::uploads().
*
!.gitignore

!promotions/
!achievements/
!birthdays/
!hosts/
!channels/
!weekly-meetings/

# Re-include the contents of each upload directory (negated after the "*" above).
!promotions/**
!achievements/**
!birthdays/**
!hosts/**
!channels/**
!weekly-meetings/**

# Temporary, partial and OS noise files never belong in the repository.
*.tmp
*.part
*.partial
*.crdownload
*.download
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini